 Standard Test Methods for Fire Tests of Building Construction and Materials</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>ASTM E2129</RID><RTL>(2024) Standard Practice for Data Collection for Sustainability Assessment of Building Products</RTL><BRK/><BRK/><RID>ASTM E2634</RID><RTL>(2018; R 2022) Standard Specification for Flat Wall Insulating Concrete Form (ICF) Systems</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF><REF><ORG>U.S. GREEN BUILDING COUNCIL (USGBC)</ORG><BRK/><BRK/><RID>LEED BD+C</RID><RTL>LEED Building Design and Construction</RTL><BRK/><BRK/></REF></SPT><SPT><TTL>SUBMITTALS</TTL><BRK/>
